Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?[daveey]=20overlap=20guards:=20pin=20newline=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?clause=20end,=20"never",=20the=20=E2=80=99=20apostrophe=20and?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20one-sided=20replace=20markers?=
